@page "/access-denied"

<PageTitle>Access denied</PageTitle>

<h1>Access denied</h1>
<p>You are signed in, but your ID token does not contain the access code this page requires.</p>
<ol>
    <li>Go to <a href="access-codes">Access codes</a> and assign the right code (Warehouse A = <code>ADVCD01</code>, Warehouse B = <code>ADVCD02</code>).</li>
    <li>Sign out and sign in again so the new group lands in your token.</li>
</ol>
